{"id":"db2d7825decf5000","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-tall.md","title":"Tall Cardinal","display":"df-tall — Tall Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tall","aliases":["58-df-tall"],"display":"df-tall — Tall Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tall"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tall</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tall — Tall Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal.md\">58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fc577c79c699e0c\" href=\"?note=0fc577c79c699e0c\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 表示二分类型元语言的类变元类型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}\\)</span> 为该类型上的存在量词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,M\\in\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(j,M\\in\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S:\\mathrm{Class}^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S:\\mathrm{Class}^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> 表示非平凡类初等嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span>（临界点）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S:\\mathrm{Class}\\times V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S:\\mathrm{Class}\\times V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（此处定义的环境宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-序列封闭谓词）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-tall 谓词）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tall}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Tall}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（此处定义的 tall cardinal 谓词）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fc577c79c699e0c\" href=\"?note=0fc577c79c699e0c\" title=\"58-df-class-elementary-embedding\">58-df-class-elementary-embedding</a> 的展开定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 与该文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> 为同一元语言类型。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tall\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}closure} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tall\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}closure} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theta\\text{-}tall} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}M,j\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S(M,\\kappa)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theta\\text{-}tall} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}M,j\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{ClosedUnderSequences}_S(M,\\kappa)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tall} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Tall}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tall} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Tall}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\lambda\\geq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{ThetaTall}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>tallness 不仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span> 越过任意给定高度，还要求目标模型对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-序列封闭。</li>\n<li>只写“存在临界点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\">\\(j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\)</span> 的嵌入”会遗漏 tall cardinal 与较弱高跳跃性质之间的关键区别。</li>\n<li>与 measurable、strongly compact、supercompact 等性质的蕴含或一致性强度比较需要具体定理，不写入本定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 是真类嵌入，不能套用只接受集合编码结构的三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span>；本原子明确在二分类型类论元语言中量化类，并把序列封闭展开为集合函数条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"ta